            pb(["A letter from her lawyer", "Ett brev från hennes jurist"], ["The reporter's lawyer writes: unless the statement is withdrawn by tomorrow, she will take legal action. Do you still say “no comment”?", "Reporterns jurist skriver: om uttalandet inte dras tillbaka senast i morgon går hon vidare rättsligt. Säger ni fortfarande ”inga kommentarer”?"]),
            pb(["You already know", "Ni vet redan"], ["Your own logs already show a hijack. “The investigation is ongoing” hides a conclusion you already have. If that becomes known, what is left of your credibility?", "Era egna loggar visar redan en kapning. ”Utredningen pågår” döljer en slutsats ni redan har. Om det blir känt, vad finns kvar av er trovärdighet?"])
